#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:2150
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"1 long epic round — igloo needs 20 pieces, all enemies from the start, "
msgstr "1 긴 서사 라운드 - igloo는 20 조각, 시작에서 모든 적,"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1579
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "10 sections of increasing difficulty. Destroy bridges to advance. "
msgstr "증가 어려움의 10 단면도. 스트로이 브리지 사전에."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1402
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"2-minute rounds, best of 3. Modes: Classic (open field) and Maze Battle. "
msgstr "2 분 라운드, 3의 최고 모드: 클래식 (오픈 필드) 및 미즈 전투."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1514
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"3 shared lives, 50 neon blocks (5 rows), ball speeds up. Arrow keys or A/D "
"to move."
msgstr "3 공유 생활, 50 네온 블록 (5 행), 공 속도. 화살표 키 또는 A/D 이동."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1909
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "3-minute race in permanent darkness with fog bursts. "
msgstr "fog 파열을 가진 영원한 어둠 속에서 3 분 경주."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:2716
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "32 deathmatch-focused arena maps for the DOOM engine. BSD license."
msgstr "DOOM 엔진을 위한 32개의 죽음 초점이 있는 경기장 맵. BSD 라이센스."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1627
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "5 sections of intense River Raid action — river starts narrow, "
msgstr "강렬한 강 레이드 액션의 5 섹션 - 강은 좁은 시작,"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1853
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "5 waves of pure chaos from the start. "
msgstr "시작에서 순수한 chaos의 5 파도."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1284
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "7 days"
msgstr "7 일"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1936
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "90 seconds to score maximum overtakes. "
msgstr "90 초 최대 절전을 점수."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:2803
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"A Viking-themed DOOM total conversion with hand-drawn pixel art — axes, "
"bows, and runic magic. Cacoward 2018 winner."
msgstr "손으로 그리는 픽셀 아트 - 축, 활 및 런직 마술과 함께 바이킹 테마 DOOM 총 변환. Cacoward 2018 수상자"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:2687
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"A complete free replacement for DOOM II — 32 levels with the Super Shotgun. "
"Compatible with community PWAD mods."
msgstr "DOOM II의 완전 무료 교체 - 슈퍼 샷건과 32 레벨. 커뮤니티 PWAD mods와 호환."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:2858
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"A complete free replacement for Quake — original levels, art, and music "
"under BSD license."
msgstr "Quake를위한 완벽한 무료 교체 - BSD 라이센스의 원본 수준, 예술 및 음악."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:2657
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"A complete free replacement for Ultimate DOOM — 4 episodes, 36 levels with "
"original art and music."
msgstr "Ultimate DOOM을위한 완벽한 무료 교체 - 4 에피소드, 원래 예술과 음악 36 레벨."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:2772
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"A cyberpunk DOOM total conversion with new weapons, enemies, and levels. "
"Standalone v1.2 IWAD."
msgstr "새로운 무기, 적, 레벨로 사이버펑크 DOOM 총 변환. 독립 v1.2 IWAD."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:141
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Access user actions and channel operations through right-click context "
